# Excludes from the production build context.

# 1. Secrets & local state
# Keep this list in sync with .gitignore — the two are independent, and the
# builder stage does `COPY . .`, so anything missing here is uploaded to the
# remote builder even when git ignores it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/plan.md
**/cookies.txt
**/*.cookies.txt
**/allowed_chat_ids.txt

# 2. Build artifacts & local runs
/media-bot
/mediabot-temp/
**/*.log

# 3. VCS & tooling
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
.github
.idea
.idea/shelf
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/httpRequests
.idea/queries
.idea/dataSources
.idea/dataSources.local.xml
.vscode
.claude

# 4. Other infra folders not needed in prod image
.infra/dev

# 5. Fly config itself — read by flyctl outside the build context
.infra/prod/fly.toml

# 6. OS cruft
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
